R1_yes  : 1st-pass results yes. Results auto-classified as YES from 1st-pass.
R1_no   : 1st-pass results no. Results auto-classified as NO from 1st-pass.
Q1_yes  : 1st-pass YES queue. Items auto-classified YES awaiting manual YES classification.

