  b) Move original pairs to running directory (for revert support).
        mv P1/queued/pairs P1/running/pairs.orig

1.2) COMPLETE: There are completed results to process from the 1st-pass YES/NO classifier.
  a) Split results into YES and NO (filter.py).                                R1_filt -> (R1_yes, R1_no)
     i. YES go to "need manual review" queue.                                  Q1_yes <- Q1_yes ∪ R1_yes
